{"seq":1,"slug":"git-in-the-agent-era","title":"Git In The Agent Era","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/git-in-the-agent-era","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"git-as-the-safety-net","title":"Git 作为 Agent 的安全网","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/git-in-the-agent-era/git-as-the-safety-net","wordCount":1861,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"small-commits-and-reversibility","title":"小提交与可逆性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/git-in-the-agent-era/small-commits-and-reversibility","wordCount":2122,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"shared-history-with-agents","title":"与 Agent 共享的历史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/git-in-the-agent-era/shared-history-with-agents","wordCount":1881,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章讲清 git 在 agent 时代被放大的角色:它是让你敢放手用 agent 的安全网——因为每一步都被记录、可回滚,agent 出错的最坏情况只是&quot;回退一步&quot;;小步提交是这张安全网的关键——改动越小越频繁,可审、可定位、可回滚的粒度就越细;而 git 历史是人和 agent 共享的记录——清晰的历史让双方都能追溯&quot;这是怎么演变的、为什么这么改&quot;。</p>\n"}